<title>HONG KONG: Henderson Land year net up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Henderson Land year net up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   516.0 vs 440.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    143.0 vs 130.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    8,361.55 vs 7,028.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		     15,275.76 vs 11,170.69</p>
<p>    Company name		 Henderson Land Development Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 30 to November 12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Henderson Land is an investment holding, construction, property management and finance company.</p>
<p>The company proposed a special cash bonus of HK$1 vs HK$1 per share.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 303 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 60 cents and special cash bonus) vs 280 cents (including interim dividend and special cash bonus).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
